{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 34, "timestamp": 1787929387, "idle_time_limit": 1.6, "env": {"SHELL": "/nix/store/l9k32vj2aczxw62134j1x0dsh569jz2l-bash-5.2p37/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "Agentic SDLC — the same control layer, running in CI"}
[1.212268, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;142m  The same control layer, running in CI\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2molafkfreund/agentic-sdlc-showcase — nothing below is read from a previous run.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[1.2131, "m", "What guards the default branch"]
[1.2131, "o", "\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m  Pipeline 1 · What guards the default branch\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mThese are required status checks, not advisory ones. A pull request cannot\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mmerge until each reports green. Three of the four are the deterministic gates.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m$ gh api repos/olafkfreund/agentic-sdlc-showcase/branches/main/protection/required_status_checks --jq .contexts[] | \"  required: \\(.)\"\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[1.264686, "o", "\u001b]11;?\u001b\\\u001b[6n"]
[6.271824, "o", "\u001b]11;?\u001b\\\u001b[6n"]
[11.553624, "o", "\u001b[?1h\u001b=\r  required: Deterministic gates\u001b[m\r\n  required: Build, test, lint\u001b[m\r\n  required: Configuration evals\u001b[m\r\n  required: Substitution Test (Appendix C)\u001b[m\r\n\r\u001b[K\u001b[?1l\u001b>"]
[11.559266, "o", "  \u001b[2mAnd the human requirement that sits alongside them:\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[11.559407, "o", "  \u001b[1m$ gh api repos/olafkfreund/agentic-sdlc-showcase/branches/main/protection/required_pull_request_reviews --jq \"  code owner review:        \\(.require_code_owner_reviews)\r\n  approval invalidated by push: \\(.require_last_push_approval)\"\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[11.614226, "o", "\u001b]11;?\u001b\\\u001b[6n"]
[16.621586, "o", "\u001b]11;?\u001b\\\u001b[6n"]
[21.853143, "o", "\u001b[?1h\u001b=\r  code owner review:        true\u001b[m\r\n  approval invalidated by push: true\u001b[m\r\n\r\u001b[K\u001b[?1l\u001b>"]
[21.857675, "m", "Every stage has a workflow, and every workflow has run"]
[21.857675, "o", "\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m  Pipeline 2 · Every stage has a workflow, and every workflow has run\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[21.85774, "o", "\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[21.857774, "o", "  \u001b[2mA workflow that has never executed is a claim, not a control. This is the\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mcount per workflow, from the API rather than from a screenshot.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m$ gh run list -R 'olafkfreund/agentic-sdlc-showcase' -L 100 --json name --jq '[.[].name]|group_by(.)|map(\"  \\(.[0]): \\(length) run(s)\")|.[]' | sort\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[23.238632, "o", "  Gates: 2 run(s)\r\n  Pages: 9 run(s)\r\n  Stage 0 — Foundations: 12 run(s)\r\n  Stage 1 — Intent: 2 run(s)\r\n  Stage 2 — Design: 5 run(s)\r\n  Stage 4 — Test: 12 run(s)\r\n  Stage 5 — Release: 10 run(s)\r\n  Stage 5 — Review: 2 run(s)\r\n  Stage 6 — Operate: 1 run(s)\r\n"]
[23.239547, "o", "\r\n\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[23.239562, "m", "Stage 6 \u2014 the loop closes, with no human in the invocation path"]
[23.239562, "o", "\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m  Pipeline 3 · Stage 6 — the loop closes, with no human in the invocation path\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[23.23957, "o", "\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[1m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[23.239625, "o", "  \u001b[2mA deterministic detector runs Western Electric rules over a 30-day rolling\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mbaseline. No model decides whether something is anomalous: a model that did\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mwould be a control you could not evidence.\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mAt 3 sigma the agent writes its finding as an intent.md and pushes a branch.\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mIt cannot open the pull request — this repository declines the setting that\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[23.239642, "o", "  \u001b[2mwould allow that, because it is one toggle covering both 'create' and\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m'approve'. So it falls back to a triage issue, and a human opens the PR.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[23.239688, "o", "  \u001b[1m$ gh workflow run 06-operate.yml -R olafkfreund/agentic-sdlc-showcase\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[23.292913, "o", "\u001b]11;?\u001b\\\u001b[6n"]
[28.300624, "o", "\u001b]11;?\u001b\\\u001b[6n"]
[35.30067, "o", "\u001b[0;32m✓\u001b[0m Created workflow_dispatch event for \u001b[0;36m06-operate.yml\u001b[0m at \u001b[0;1;39mmain\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nTo see runs for this workflow, try: \u001b[0;1;39mgh run list --workflow=06-operate.yml\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[35.304347, "o", "  \u001b[2mWatching it live:\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[41.876601, "o", "  \u001b[1m$ gh run watch 33183271749\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[41.93064, "o", "\u001b]11;?\u001b\\\u001b[6n"]
[46.939181, "o", "\u001b]11;?\u001b\\\u001b[6n"]
[52.668166, "o", "\u001b[?1049h"]
[53.760419, "o", "\u001b[0;0H\u001b[J\u001b[0;1;39mRefreshing run status every 5 seconds. Press Ctrl+C to quit.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[0;33m*\u001b[0m \u001b[0;1;39mmain\u001b[0m Stage 6 — Operate · \u001b[0;36m33183271749\u001b[0m\r\nTriggered via workflow_dispatch less than a minute ago\r\n\r\n\u001b[0;1;39mJOBS\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;33m*\u001b[0m \u001b[0;1;39mDetect (no model)\u001b[0m (ID \u001b[0;36m98889660457\u001b[0m)\r\n  \u001b[0;32m✓\u001b[0m Set up job\r\n  \u001b[0;32m✓\u001b[0m Run actions/checkout@v4\r\n  \u001b[0;33m*\u001b[0m Run ./.github/actions/setup\r\n  \u001b[0;33m*\u001b[0m Run python -m pytest scripts/tests/test_detect_anomaly.py -q\r\n  \u001b[0;33m*\u001b[0m Run python scripts/detect_anomaly.py --metrics \"ops/fixtures/post_deploy_error_rate.json\"\r\n  \u001b[0;33m*\u001b[0m Run actions/upload-artifact@v4\r\n  \u001b[0;33m*\u001b[0m Post Run ./.github/actions/setup\r\n  \u001b[0;33m*\u001b[0m Post Run actions/checkout@v4\r\n\u001b[38;5;242m-\u001b[0m \u001b[0;1;39mScheduled codebase scan\u001b[0m (ID \u001b[0;36m98889661589\u001b[0m)\r\n"]
[59.586234, "o", "\u001b[0;0H\u001b[J\u001b[0;1;39mRefreshing run status every 5 seconds. Press Ctrl+C to quit.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[0;33m*\u001b[0m \u001b[0;1;39mmain\u001b[0m Stage 6 — Operate · \u001b[0;36m33183271749\u001b[0m\r\nTriggered via workflow_dispatch less than a minute ago\r\n\r\n\u001b[0;1;39mJOBS\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;33m*\u001b[0m \u001b[0;1;39mDetect (no model)\u001b[0m (ID \u001b[0;36m98889660457\u001b[0m)\r\n  \u001b[0;32m✓\u001b[0m Set up job\r\n  \u001b[0;32m✓\u001b[0m Run actions/checkout@v4\r\n  \u001b[0;32m✓\u001b[0m Run ./.github/actions/setup\r\n  \u001b[0;32m✓\u001b[0m Run python -m pytest scripts/tests/test_detect_anomaly.py -q\r\n  \u001b[0;32m✓\u001b[0m Run python scripts/detect_anomaly.py --metrics \"ops/fixtures/post_deploy_error_rate.json\"\r\n  \u001b[0;32m✓\u001b[0m Run actions/upload-artifact@v4\r\n  \u001b[0;32m✓\u001b[0m Post Run ./.github/actions/setup\r\n  \u001b[0;33m*\u001b[0m Post Run actions/checkout@v4\r\n\u001b[38;5;242m-\u001b[0m \u001b[0;1;39mScheduled codebase scan\u001b[0m (ID \u001b[0;36m98889661589\u001b[0m)\r\n"]
