[147.966759, "o", "\u001b[?1h\u001b=\r  success  2026-08-28T14:47  Record that enforce_admins is off, and the merge tha\u001b[m\r\n  success  2026-08-28T14:14  CHG-2026-014906: Stage 6 anomaly becomes an intent\u001b[m\r\n  success  2026-08-28T14:03  Make lint agree across the whole supported ruff rang\u001b[m\r\n  success  2026-08-28T13:57  CHG-2026-014907: a pinned environment and one comman\u001b[m\r\n\r\u001b[K\u001b[?1l\u001b>"]
[147.971208, "o", "  \u001b[2mProduction is a GitHub environment with a required reviewer — the gate is configuration, not a paragraph in a runbook:\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
